Package: linfan
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: LinFan <ci@linfan.local>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6
Recommends: libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6
Description: Cross-platform fan control (systemd daemon + Avalonia GUI)
 LinFan drives fan curves from temperature sensors via a privileged systemd
 daemon; the unprivileged GUI connects over a local socket. This package ships
 a self-contained build, so no .NET runtime is required on the target.
 .
 Note: writing PWM needs hardware support (e.g. thinkpad_acpi fan_control=1 on
 ThinkPads); otherwise the daemon runs read-only.
